|desc=A character with this [[feat]] reduces the penalties suffered when [[dual-wield|fighting with two weapons]]. The normal penalty of -6 to the primary hand and -10 to the [[off-hand]] becomes -4 for the primary hand and -8 for the off-hand. The [[ambidexterity]] feat further reduces the attack penalty for the second weapon by 4 (to -4/-4). Best results are achieved if the off-hand weapon is [[light weapon|light]], further reducing the penalty for both the primary and off-hand by 2 (to -2/-2).
