==Notes==
*First level [[ranger]]s receive the [[dual-wield (feat)|dual-wield]] feat, which is a combination of ''ambidexterity'' and ''two-weapon fighting'' that does not function while wearing [[medium armor|medium]] or [[heavy armor]].
*A [[double-sided weapon]], such as a [[two-bladed sword]] or a [[dire mace]], counts as a light weapon when dealing with the off-hand, allowing it to be wielded with minimal penalties.

